  "body": "**Blocked by:** #206\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #206 and completes the `mail-search-czech-dict` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd forward migration/helper: with assets create czech_hunspell ispell and map Czech word tokens through it ahead of unaccent/simple; without assets migration succeeds/preserves fallback. Add idempotent post-provision DB activation invoked by deployment so previously recorded fallback migration upgrades later. Keep websearch_to_tsquery, ranking, operators unchanged.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No other languages, parsing/ranking, or extraction changes.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- With assets ts_lexize/inflected terms prove stemming.\n- Without assets migration/search fallback works.\n- Later install+activation upgrades existing DB.\n- Repeated activation no-op and query code unchanged.\n",
